                                "sense_id": "a206da2e-c76c-396d-bd65-bbd994887e75",
                                "text": "Part toy box and part cabinet of curiosities for a young misfit finally finding his tribe, the house has competition only from Black, who always excels in roles that let him play an excitable kid in a grown man’s body, and does so here as the bumbling, sorcerous Uncle Jonathan, forever knocking things over[…]"
                            },
                            {
