                                "sense_id": "a206da2e-c76c-396d-bd65-bbd994887e75",
                                "text": "That record was about the seductive power of “the aesthetics of wealth”—fashion runways, status brands, velvet-rope glamour—with the sorcerous allure of artifice and illusion seemingly left unchallenged."
                            }
